\newlabel{tab:vision_closed_loop}{{4.16}{55}{Closed-loop vision pipeline, policy driven on image-predicted avoidance-path state with a frozen encoder in the loop. The full pixels-to-control pipeline holds in both directions, a few points of crash above the ground-truth-state policy from prediction noise.\relax }{table.caption.60}{}}
